you'll familiarize yourself
with Google's Agent Development Kit,

8
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.390
and you'll use that for building agents
throughout this multi-agent system.

9
00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.792
In this lesson, you'll learn how to

